BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Outdoor Flow Yogis
UID:event_317191442@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052548Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T181500
SUMMARY:outdoor mat pilates
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Flow Yogis\nEnjoy movement and breath work with 45-min
 ute classic mat pilates sessions at [Dix Park](https://dixpark.org/). Thes
 e FREE outdoor classes welcome all experience levels and focus on core str
 ength and stability\, coordination\, and flexibility.\n\nMeet us in front 
 of the Gipson Play Plaza fountain! Bring a mat\, towel\, and filled water 
 bottle. Allow yourself a little extra time for parking\, we'll get started
  right at 5:30pm.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/outdoorflowyogis/events/317191442/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261029T153016Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T153016Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Outdoor Flow Yogis
UID:event_316282218@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052548Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T120000
SUMMARY:Sunday Yoga at Trophy
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Flow Yogis\n**S﻿unday Yoga** classes take place mont
 hly at [Trophy Brewing](https://www.trophybrewing.com/brewery-taproom)'s M
 aywood location. Join us inside the brewery or out on the lawn for a 60-mi
 nute yoga flow for all experience levels. Beginners welcome! Bring your ma
 t and any props you like to use.\n\nRegistration includes one drink ticket
 \, so stick around after class to enjoy a Trophy pint or non-alcoholic bev
 erage and relax with the crew—great way to start your Sunday FUNday.\n\n
 Cost: $22 cash/venmo at the door or reserve online [here](https://trophysu
 ndayyoga2026.eventbrite.com/).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/outdoorflowyogis/events/316282218/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260826T152137Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T152137Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
